Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:14:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] feat(admin): phase-based host console with a lobby and
 clearer hierarchy

- PhaseBar stepper (Lobby -> Rounds N/N -> Fast Money) shows where the host is.
- Dedicated Lobby view before the game: big join code/URL, per-team roster with
  counts and empty states, and a 'what to do next' line.
- One obvious primary button per phase (Start Round 1 in the lobby, Next Round
  in a round); the rest are secondary. Added tooltips and a per-phase hint line.
- Also sends the host password on the player blindfold toggle so it keeps
  working under the new server authorization.
